        ['ref' => 'GAS-CP-R88-001', 'version' => '1.105.0', 'date' => '2026-11-06', 'title' => 'Inventory: document web links on every item (datasheet, manual, drawing, certificate, software, supplier page); software inventoried as licences (item type Software — key, serial, seats, kind, expiry, assigned to project / vessel / user / organisation; keys visible to procurement administrators only; a goods receipt creates a pending licence; expiring licences in Inventory › Software and in the Shortages console). Procurement: Request for Offer to several suppliers — invited suppliers, ✉ / PDF per supplier, quotation typed per supplier, comparison (lowest per line, cheapest / fastest), award to one. Goods receipt: each line goes to stock or straight to the project on a delivery note; Inventory › Delivery notes register (to project / vessel, to customer, to production, return to supplier) with numbered PDF, ✉ card, cancellation returning the goods to stock.', 'db' => 'install/migrate_cp_r88_001_links_software_rfo_dn.sql', 'check' => 'r88a'],
